  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2024200,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202420000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202420000": {
          "id": 202420000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "You've all been working so hard lately. Once we've wrapped up our current tasks, I'll organize a big dinner party for the Express crew",
          "next": [
            202420001
          ]
        },
        "202420001": {
          "id": 202420001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I'll show off some of my skills at the party. Are you interested in helping me prep the meal?",
          "next": [
            202420002,
            202420005,
            202420008
          ]
        },
        "202420002": {
          "id": 202420002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Sure! Who's cooking, though? Me? Or you, Himeko?",
          "next": [
            202420003
          ]
        },
        "202420003": {
          "id": 202420003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Though neither option sounds particularly safe...",
          "next": [
            202420004
          ]
        },
        "202420004": {
          "id": 202420004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Don't worry, I won't be the one cooking",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420005": {
          "id": 202420005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Sounds great! You do the cooking, Himeko, and I'll handle the tasting",
          "next": [
            202420006
          ]
        },
        "202420006": {
          "id": 202420006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wait, Himeko's cooking...?",
          "next": [
            202420007
          ]
        },
        "202420007": {
          "id": 202420007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Don't worry, I won't be the one cooking",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420008": {
          "id": 202420008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "After the last time you \"showed off your skills,\" we were taking turns running to the bathroom. Guess it counted as a workout!",
          "next": [
            202420009
          ]
        },
        "202420009": {
          "id": 202420009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Rest assured, that won't happen again",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420010": {
          "id": 202420010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "There's an automatic cooking machine I built from scratch sitting in the storage car. I'm planning to bring it out of retirement",
          "next": [
            202420011
          ]
        },
        "202420011": {
          "id": 202420011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Some of the parts have rusted, so it's about time I gave it an overhaul anyway",
          "next": [
            202420012
          ]
        },
        "202420012": {
          "id": 202420012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I mentioned before that I'd bring you along next time I did maintenance on the Express. Since I need to fix up the cooking machine and the principles are the same, I figured I'd invite you",
          "next": [
            202420013,
            202420014,
            202420016
          ]
        },
        "202420013": {
          "id": 202420013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The principles of repairing a train and a cooking machine are the same in what way, exactly...?",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420014": {
          "id": 202420014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Oh, so that's what you meant by showing off your skills! As expected of our master mechanic, Miss Himeko!",
          "next": [
            202420015
          ]
        },
        "202420015": {
          "id": 202420015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "But... the principles are the same in what way exactly?",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420016": {
          "id": 202420016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wait, I have to repair the train... I mean, I have to repair the cooking machine too... No, wait, how are the principles even the same...?",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420017": {
          "id": 202420017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Energy transmission, thermodynamic cycles, mechanical rotation... the underlying theories are more or less identical. The only difference is that one drives the stars, and the other drives a spatula",
          "next": [
            202420018
          ]
        },
        "202420018": {
          "id": 202420018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Besides that, it just needs a smart-cooking system to adjust the heat and seasoning for different taste preferences",
          "next": [
            202420019
          ]
        },
        "202420019": {
          "id": 202420019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Which is fundamentally the same as studying the driving habits of the navigator and the conductor",
          "next": [
            202420020,
            202420027
          ]
        },
        "202420020": {
          "id": 202420020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So what you're saying is, once I learn how to fix a cooking machine, I'll know how to fix the Astral Express...",
          "next": [
            202420021
          ]
        },
        "202420021": {
          "id": 202420021,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "next": [
            202420022
          ]
        },
        "202420022": {
          "id": 202420022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Exactly, that's the logic",
          "next": [
            202420023
          ]
        },
        "202420023": {
          "id": 202420023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I was just joking around!",
          "next": [
            202420024
          ]
        },
        "202420024": {
          "id": 202420024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "That's fine, I wasn't",
          "next": [
            202420025
          ]
        },
        "202420025": {
          "id": 202420025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Trust me, you'll understand once we get hands-on with it~",
          "next": [
            202420026
          ]
        },
        "202420026": {
          "id": 202420026,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "next": []
        },
        "202420027": {
          "id": 202420027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So what you're saying is, once I learn how to fix a cooking machine, I'll know how to fix the Astral Express...",
          "next": [
